   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "About a dozen scripts across the family, most only historical. Living varieties use Perso-Arabic, Latin and\nCyrillic, often in parallel; Tajik uses Cyrillic only. Priority: one shared Iranic normalization library.",
